[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AC-SDD003
TITLE: Point-mass integration and the rectangular pattern
STATEMENT: >>>
The local frame shall put the runway threshold at the origin. Heading zero shall be north and shall increase clockwise. The hold-short point shall be the configured distance before the threshold. Line up shall be 100 feet past the threshold. The crosswind corner shall be the upwind distance ahead and the pattern offset to the pattern side. The downwind end and the final intercept shall be one pattern offset before the threshold. Capture inside a step shall place the aircraft on a reached waypoint. On final, target altitude shall follow a straight glide from pattern altitude to field elevation, except a low approach whose target is the configured height. Acceptance is a deterministic one-second step and a pattern mission that reaches the downwind and then the new facility.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The geometry is simple so the phrase and the position stay tied together.
<<<
DAL: E
